          },
          "pluginVersion": "10.2.0",
          "targets": [
            {
              "columns": [],
              "datasource": {
                "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
                "uid": "powsybl-api"
              },
              "filters": [],
              "format": "table",
              "global_query_id": "",
              "refId": "A",
              "root_selector": "",
              "source": "url",
              "type": "json",
              "url": "http://10.217.5.224:8000/api/v1/loadflow",
              "url_options": {
                "data": "{\"network_id\":\"ieee14\"}",
                "method": "POST",
                "headers": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "title": "計算時間",
          "type": "stat"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
            "uid": "powsybl-api"
          },
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "custom": {
                "align": "auto",
                "cellOptions": {
                  "type": "color-background"
                },
                "inspect": false
              },
              "mappings": [],
              "thresholds": {
                "mode": "absolute",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "color": "red",
                    "value": null
                  },
                  {
                    "color": "yellow",
                    "value": 0.95
                  },
                  {
                    "color": "green",
                    "value": 1.0
                  },
                  {
                    "color": "yellow",
                    "value": 1.05
                  },
                  {
                    "color": "red",
                    "value": 1.1
                  }
                ]
              },
              "unit": "none"
            },
            "overrides": [
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byName",
                  "options": "voltage_magnitude"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "displayName",
                    "value": "電圧 (p.u.)"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "decimals",
                    "value": 3
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byName",
                  "options": "voltage_angle"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "displayName",
                    "value": "位相角 (deg)"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "decimals",
                    "value": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                    "value": {
                      "type": "auto"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 8,
            "w": 12,
            "x": 12,
            "y": 5
          },
          "id": 4,
          "options": {
            "cellHeight": "sm",
            "footer": {
              "countRows": false,
              "fields": "",
              "reducer": [
                "sum"
              ],
              "show": false
            },
            "showHeader": true
          },
          "pluginVersion": "10.2.0",
          "targets": [
            {
              "columns": [],
              "datasource": {
                "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
                "uid": "powsybl-api"
              },
              "filters": [],
              "format": "table",
              "global_query_id": "",
              "refId": "A",
              "root_selector": "buses",
              "source": "url",
              "type": "json",
              "url": "http://10.217.5.224:8000/api/v1/loadflow",
              "url_options": {
                "data": "{\"network_id\":\"ieee14\"}",
                "method": "POST",
                "headers": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "title": "14バス電圧プロファイル (今日の出発点)",
          "type": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": null,
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 2,
            "w": 24,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 13
          },
          "id": 102,
          "options": {
            "code": {
              "language": "plaintext",
              "showLineNumbers": false,
              "showMiniMap": false
            },
            "content": "## シーン2: 需要が動き始める時間 (09:30)\n\n朝のピーク需要が立ち上がると、Load Flowが5分ごとに自動トリガーされる。B9母線のトレンドを見ていると、電圧が0.952 p.u.まで静かに降下してくる。デジタルツインは「このままあと2回の計算サイクルで下限を割る」という未来を先読みし、変圧器タップ制御を自律的に起動する。",
            "mode": "markdown"
          },
          "pluginVersion": "10.2.0",
          "title": "シーン2ヘッダー",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "influxdb"
          },
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "color": {
                "mode": "palette-classic"
              },
              "custom": {
                "axisCenteredZero": false,
                "axisColorMode": "text",
                "axisLabel": "Voltage (p.u.)",
                "axisPlacement": "auto",
                "barAlignment": 0,
                "drawStyle": "line",
                "fillOpacity": 20,
                "gradientMode": "opacity",
                "hideFrom": {
                  "tooltip": false,
                  "viz": false,
                  "legend": false
                },
                "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
                "lineWidth": 3,
                "pointSize": 5,
                "scaleDistribution": {
                  "type": "linear"
                },
                "showPoints": "never",
                "spanNulls": true,
                "stacking": {
                  "group": "A",
                  "mode": "none"
                },
                "thresholdsStyle": {
                  "mode": "line"
                }
              },
              "mappings": [],
              "thresholds": {
                "mode": "absolute",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "color": "red",
                    "value": null
                  },
                  {
                    "color": "yellow",
                    "value": 0.95
                  },
                  {
                    "color": "green",
                    "value": 0.97
                  }
                ]
              },
              "unit": "short"
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 8,
            "w": 12,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 15
          },
          "id": 5,
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "calcs": ["mean", "lastNotNull", "min"],
              "displayMode": "table",
              "placement": "bottom",
              "showLegend": true
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "datasource": {
                "type": "influxdb",
                "uid": "influxdb"
              },
              "query": "import \"math\"\n\nfrom(bucket: \"telemetry\")\n  |> range(start: v.timeRangeStart, stop: v.timeRangeStop)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r[\"_measurement\"] == \"substation_telemetry\")\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r[\"_field\"] == \"voltage_a\")\n  |> aggregateWindow(every: v.windowPeriod, fn: mean, createEmpty: false)\n  |> map(fn: (r) => ({ r with _value: math.abs(x: r._value) / 22000.0 }))",
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Bus9母線 電圧トレンド (予防的介入の転換点)",
          "type": "timeseries"
        },
        {
          "datasource": null,
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 8,
            "w": 12,
            "x": 12,
            "y": 15
          },
          "id": 6,
          "options": {
            "code": {
              "language": "plaintext",
              "showLineNumbers": false,
              "showMiniMap": false
            },
            "content": "### 予測と自律制御\n\n**現在の電圧:** 0.952 p.u.\n\n**予測:**\n- 次回計算(5分後): 0.948 p.u. (予測)\n- 2回後(10分後): **0.943 p.u.** (下限0.95を割る)\n\n**自律制御:**\n- 変圧器タップ制御を起動\n- タップ位置: +2段 → +3段へ変更\n- 予想電圧回復: 0.968 p.u.\n\n**系統運用の転換:**\n- 旧: 閾値超過後に警報 → 事後対応\n- 新: 未来予測 → **予防的介入**",
            "mode": "markdown"
          },
          "pluginVersion": "10.2.0",
          "title": "予防的介入の詳細",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "datasource": null,
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 2,
            "w": 24,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 23
          },
          "id": 103,
          "options": {
            "code": {
              "language": "plaintext",
              "showLineNumbers": false,
              "showMiniMap": false
            },
            "content": "## シーン3: 想定外の一撃 (12:15)\n\nL-14が保護リレー動作で開放する。PowSyBlのセキュリティ分析エンジンは**8.3秒で52コンティンジェンシーを並列評価し**、L-12・L-15・T-09の3本の制約違反を特定、さらに「GEN-3を45MW削減しGEN-7を45MW増出力すれば違反が解消する」という是正措置案まで提示する。",
            "mode": "markdown"
          },
          "pluginVersion": "10.2.0",
          "title": "シーン3ヘッダー",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
            "uid": "powsybl-api"
          },
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "color": {
                "mode": "thresholds"
              },
              "mappings": [],
              "thresholds": {
                "mode": "absolute",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "color": "green",
                    "value": null
                  },
                  {
                    "color": "red",
                    "value": 1
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 4,
            "w": 6,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 25
          },
          "id": 7,
          "options": {
            "colorMode": "background",
            "graphMode": "area",
            "justifyMode": "auto",
            "orientation": "auto",
            "reduceOptions": {
              "values": false,
              "calcs": [
                "lastNotNull"
              ],
              "fields": "/^summary\\.total_contingencies$/"
            },
            "textMode": "value_and_name"
          },
          "pluginVersion": "10.2.0",
          "targets": [
            {
              "columns": [],
              "datasource": {
                "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
                "uid": "powsybl-api"
              },
              "filters": [],
              "format": "table",
              "global_query_id": "",
              "refId": "A",
              "root_selector": "",
              "source": "url",
              "type": "json",
              "url": "http://10.217.5.224:8000/api/v1/security",
              "url_options": {
                "data": "{\"network_id\":\"ieee14\",\"contingencies\":[{\"id\":\"L14-trip\",\"elements\":[\"L9-14-1\"]}]}",
                "method": "POST",
                "headers": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "title": "評価コンティンジェンシー数",
          "type": "stat"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
            "uid": "powsybl-api"
          },
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "color": {
                "mode": "thresholds"
              },
              "mappings": [],
              "thresholds": {
                "mode": "absolute",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "color": "green",
                    "value": null
                  },
                  {
                    "color": "yellow",
                    "value": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "color": "red",
                    "value": 3
                  }
                ]
              },
              "unit": "ms"
            }
          },
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 4,
            "w": 6,
            "x": 6,
            "y": 25
          },
          "id": 8,
          "options": {
            "colorMode": "value",
            "graphMode": "area",
            "justifyMode": "auto",
            "orientation": "auto",
            "reduceOptions": {
              "values": false,
              "calcs": [
                "lastNotNull"
              ],
              "fields": "/^summary\\.computation_time_ms$/"
            },
            "textMode": "value_and_name"
          },
          "pluginVersion": "10.2.0",
          "targets": [
            {
              "columns": [],
              "datasource": {
                "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
                "uid": "powsybl-api"
              },
              "filters": [],
              "format": "table",
              "global_query_id": "",
              "refId": "A",
              "root_selector": "",
              "source": "url",
              "type": "json",
              "url": "http://10.217.5.224:8000/api/v1/security",
              "url_options": {
                "data": "{\"network_id\":\"ieee14\",\"contingencies\":[{\"id\":\"L14-trip\",\"elements\":[\"L9-14-1\"]}]}",
                "method": "POST",
                "headers": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "title": "セキュリティ分析 計算時間",
          "type": "stat"
        },
        {
          "datasource": null,
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 8,
            "w": 12,
            "x": 12,
            "y": 25
          },
          "id": 9,
          "options": {
            "code": {
              "language": "plaintext",
              "showLineNumbers": false,
              "showMiniMap": false
            },
            "content": "### セキュリティ分析結果\n\n**トリガーイベント:** L-14 保護リレー動作・開放\n\n**N-1分析結果 (8.3秒で完了):**\n\n**制約違反機器:**\n1. **L-12** - 過負荷 112% (定格比)\n2. **L-15** - 過負荷 108%\n3. **T-09** - 変圧器過負荷 105%\n\n**是正措置提案 (AI推奨):**\n- **GEN-3**: 現在出力45MW → **0MW** (△45MW削減)\n- **GEN-7**: 現在出力0MW → **45MW** (△45MW増出力)\n\n**効果予測:**\n- L-12負荷率: 112% → 94%\n- L-15負荷率: 108% → 97%\n- T-09負荷率: 105% → 98%\n\n**オペレーターの役割:** 提案を承認するか否かの判断",
            "mode": "markdown"
          },
          "pluginVersion": "10.2.0",
          "title": "是正措置提案",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "datasource": null,
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 2,
            "w": 24,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 33
          },
          "id": 104,
          "options": {
            "code": {
              "language": "plaintext",
              "showLineNumbers": false,
              "showMiniMap": false
            },
            "content": "## シーン4: 見えなかった影響を可視化する (14:45)\n\n風力発電が急速にランプアップしていく。送電線のどこに、どれだけ潮流が乗るのか——このPTDF（電力移送分布係数）の計算こそ、再生可能エネルギー大量導入時代の系統運用の核心課題だ。感度分析エンジンは2.1秒でL-22の感度係数0.38を算出する。",
            "mode": "markdown"
          },
          "pluginVersion": "10.2.0",
          "title": "シーン4ヘッダー",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
